# Local development needs no env vars — data is read/written from data/*.json
# and the admin has no password.

# Production persistence (Vercel): injected automatically when you create a Neon
# Postgres database in the Vercel Storage tab and connect it to the project.
# Leave unset locally to use the data/*.json files. The code also accepts the
# POSTGRES_* variants Vercel/Neon may set.
# DATABASE_URL=
